  "title": {
    "en": "InstructGPT",
    "zh": "InstructGPT"
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": "A three-stage RLHF pipeline that aligned language-model behavior with written instructions and human preferences",
    "zh": "通过三阶段 RLHF 流程让语言模型行为对齐书面指令与人类偏好"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "<p>InstructGPT addressed a mismatch between next-token prediction and what users actually ask a model to do. OpenAI collected demonstrations and preference comparisons, then used supervised fine-tuning, reward modeling and reinforcement learning to tune GPT-3 models toward helpful instruction following.</p><p>Human evaluators preferred the 1.3-billion-parameter InstructGPT model over the 175-billion-parameter GPT-3 baseline on the studied prompt distribution. The result made RLHF a practical recipe for post-training general-purpose language models.</p>",
    "zh": "<p>InstructGPT 针对下一个 token 预测目标与用户实际要求之间的错位。OpenAI 收集示范答案和偏好比较，再通过监督微调、奖励模型与强化学习，让 GPT-3 模型更好地遵循有帮助的指令。</p><p>在研究使用的提示分布上，人类评估者更偏好 13 亿参数的 InstructGPT，而不是 1,750 亿参数的 GPT-3 基线。这一结果使 RLHF 成为通用语言模型后训练的实用范式。</p>"
  },
